- React UI: ui-tui/src/theme.ts + slash/commands/core.ts + theme.test.ts
- 桌面 React: apps/desktop/src/app/settings/about-settings.tsx (About 鸣谢)
- 桌面 README: apps/desktop/README.md (上游描述 WenShu 化)
- installer README + src: apps/bootstrap-installer/README.md + vite.config.ts + styles.css + src-tauri/src/lib.rs + main.rs (file doc 注释)
- scripts: install.sh, install.ps1, setup-hermes.sh, hermes-gateway, whatsapp-bridge/* (banner / log / SOUL / service description / browser UA / npm description)
