- docker/SOUL.md: system prompt 'You are WenShu Agent'
- docs/setup/wenshu-installer-quickstart.md: 装机 user quickstart
- optional-skills/**/*.md: 上游 third-party skills (author field 替换)

保留 (code ID per task scope):
- HERMES_HOME env var (上游 Python 协议, install.sh 共享)
- hermes_bootstrap_lib (Rust lib name, 跟 Tauri API 一致)
- @hermes/bootstrap-installer (npm 内部 ID)
- hermes_home(), hermes_is_installed() (Rust API name)
- hermes.exe / her shim / .hermes-* (Windows 平台文件 / marker)
- launchHermesDesktop, updateHermes, startHermes (function name)
- localStorage 'hermes-boot-*' keys
- 'hermes desktop' / 'hermes update' / 'hermes setup' CLI 命令 (实际 shell 调用)
- scripts/install.sh 'HERMES_SETUP_DEV_REPO_ROOT' / 'hermes-bom-*' / 'hermes-bootstrap' (build / test 内部)
- HERMES_AGENT_TIMEOUT / HERMES_AGENT_NOTIFY_INTERVAL / etc (env var, 上游协议字段, 4 个 docs 文件 env-var 表保留)
- upstream URL github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
- pyproject.toml [project].name='hermes-agent' (v0.0.x 不改, v0.1.x 改 wenshu-agent, 0.0.1 拍板)
- plugins/*/plugin.yaml + nix/* + packaging/* + hermes_agent.rb (upstream third-party, 不在 docs/React UI 范围)
- README.es.md / README.ur-pk.md / CONTRIBUTING.es.md / SECURITY.es.md (translated artifact)
- Python docstring (tools/, hermes_cli/, agent/) (源码注释, 不在 React UI / docs 范围)

